 "source": "harness/tetrapush/deliver.py truncate-and-read on the spliced boot movie (_notes/s90_blocked.py), session 90, 2026-08-02. Each sample is one ~8 s delivery of log[:n], read at the PauseMovie halt on plan frame n-1.",
